  "expected": {
    "outcome": "failure",
    "error_code": "IDENTITY_FAILED",
    "rationale": "The Manifest verifies (RFC-AITP-0003 §5 steps 1-5), but `manifest.aid` (kat-keypair-002) and `params.aid` (kat-keypair-003) are different keys (RFC-AITP-0001 §5.3). RFC-AITP-0014 §4.2 step 4 ⇒ IDENTITY_FAILED. A tampered or shadowing Card cannot redirect trust to a key its Manifest does not prove."
  }
